1. [...]-x mu#? disz#!-am3 he2-en-zu# 
#tr.en: If a scribe knew/learned (only) one line of text 
2. [...]-ni#? he2-sa6-sa6 
#tr.en: And his hand was (nevertheless) very good 
3. [e]-ne#-am3 dub-sar-re 
#tr.en: He is a scribe 
