#tr.en: If a singer knew/learned (only) one song/hymn 
5. [...]-ni# du10-ga-am3 
#tr.en: And his lament/vocalization(?) was (nevertheless) good 
6. [e]-ne-am3 nar-am3# 
#tr.en: He is a singer/musician 
